# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment variables — [TBD]
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local workflow:
#   1. Copy this file to `.env.local` (`cp .env.example .env.local`).
#   2. Fill in values. `.env.local` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#   3. Document every new variable in this file, with an empty/commented example.
#
# Conventions:
#   - Only variables prefixed with `NEXT_PUBLIC_` are exposed to the browser.
#     Never prefix secrets with `NEXT_PUBLIC_`.
#   - Server-side secrets stay in `.env.local` / CI secrets and are read only in
#     server code (route handlers, server actions, server components).
#   - No environment variables are required to run the current scaffold.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

